<div class="page-header">
  <div class="page-header__top page-header__top--centered">
    <h1 class="page-title">Download Master CV</h1>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="show-panel" data-testid="master-cv-panel">
  <% if @cv.profile? %>
    <p>Your whole Dossier as one CV, in the Classic style: your Profile and summary, then
      <span data-testid="master-cv-contents"><%= [
        pluralize(@cv.experience.size, "Engagement"),
        pluralize(@cv.personal_projects.size, "Personal Project"),
        pluralize(@cv.credentials.sum { |section| section.entries.size }, "Credential"),
        pluralize(@cv.contributions.size, "Contribution")
      ].to_sentence %></span>, with your Skills. The file is made when you click and downloads straight away —
      nothing is stored.</p>

    <div class="show-panel show-panel--actions">
      <%= link_to docx_dossier_master_cv_path, class: "btn btn-primary", data: { turbo: false } do %>
        <%= lucide_icon("file-text", size: 16) %> Download Word
      <% end %>
      <span class="btn-divider">|</span>
      <%= link_to pdf_dossier_master_cv_path, class: "btn btn-primary", data: { turbo: false } do %>
        <%= lucide_icon("file-down", size: 16) %> Download PDF
      <% end %>
    </div>
  <% else %>
    <p data-testid="master-cv-no-profile">Create your Profile first — the CV starts from your name, headline,
      contact details and summary.</p>

    <div class="show-panel show-panel--actions">
      <%= link_to edit_dossier_profile_path, class: "btn btn-primary" do %>
        <%= lucide_icon("user", size: 16) %> Create Your Profile
      <% end %>
    </div>
  <% end %>
</div>
